% Gen443 profile: one causal claim, two irrelevant candidates.
machinery(campaign_claim).
machinery(campaign_required).
machinery(campaign_replay).
campaign_claim(c1, causal, proposition(height(mountainion, 1200)), range(10, 18)).
campaign_claim(c1, noise1, proposition(color(mountainion, blue)), range(30, 12)).
campaign_claim(c1, noise2, proposition(region(mountainion, north)), range(50, 15)).
campaign_required(c1, causal).
campaign_replay(c1, causal, proposition(height(mountainion, 1200))).
